      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2015 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "This meta-analysis includes all prospective FFR studies of the left main artery with outcomes. Patients who had deferral of revascularization in FFR-negative stenoses had no difference in cardiovascular events compared with patients who underwent revascularization. FFR-guided revascularization of left main stenosis is safe and effective."
